or a billboard is not major.

00:14:23.980 --> 00:14:24.890
Why?

00:14:24.890 --> 00:14:25.600
I don't know.

00:14:25.600 --> 00:14:27.270
Looks like.

00:14:27.270 --> 00:14:31.790
But in Korea, we are collecting
all kinds of information

00:14:31.790 --> 00:14:33.650
